WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.268
-♪ Ramen Challenge,
Ramen Challenge ♪

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.736
♪ R-A-M-E-N Challenge ♪

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:05.871 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:05.871 --> 00:00:07.073
-All right, now,
here's how this works.

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.374
-You have to go first
'cause I don't know --

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:10.142
It looks really complicated.

00:00:10.142 --> 00:00:11.343
-No, no, no.
It's not.

00:00:11.343 --> 00:00:13.246
You can totally nail this.
This is easy.

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:17.182
Our pal Chef David Chang
and this place called Sun Noodle

00:00:17.182 --> 00:00:20.320
made us these special
four foot long ramen noodles.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.389
There are six of them in this
bowl, three for each of us.

00:00:23.389 --> 00:00:26.058
And we have three shots of sake.

00:00:26.058 --> 00:00:28.428
You slurp up your whole noodle,
then you take a shot --

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:30.296
-Where do you start --
on this part...

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:32.065
-Yeah.
-...or the end?

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:33.500
-No, not the end.
You start with that part.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.236
-You take it out of the stick.
That's not some crazy thing.

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:38.471
-No, there's not a trick.
This is easy to do.

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:40.173
Just slurping noodles
like "Lady and the Tramp."

00:00:40.173 --> 00:00:42.441
You saw "Lady and the Tramp?"
-You start sucking yourself.

00:00:42.441 --> 00:00:43.676
-No.

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:45.879
-"Sucking" --

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.313
What?

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:50.917
-Then I see how you suck,
and then I try.

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:52.385
-[ Chuckling ]
What's going on?

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.954
No, slurping.
Slurping.

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:56.022
-Ah.
Slurping.

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:58.223
-I'll start slurping, myself,
and --

00:00:58.223 --> 00:00:59.992
-There's a difference between
sucking and slurping!

00:00:59.992 --> 00:01:01.060
-Yes, yes, yes, yes.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:02.294
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.294 --> 00:01:03.296
-Whatever.

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:04.630
-We'll do it
on the commercial break.

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:06.666
Uh, we will --

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:10.369
You slurp the noodle,
and then you take a shot.

00:01:10.369 --> 00:01:13.640
Whoever finishes
all three first wins.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:15.341
-Oh, we have to do it
at the same time.

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:16.742
-Yeah, and --

00:01:16.742 --> 00:01:18.111
Let's get our first noodle
in position.

00:01:18.111 --> 00:01:20.713
-But, Jimmy, you take it
out of here, no?

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:22.081
-It's just a noodle.

00:01:22.081 --> 00:01:24.683
Your teeth can probably bite
through it if you want to,

00:01:24.683 --> 00:01:26.820
but -- All right.
And it's also customary --

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:28.988
-I just don't understand
the stick part!

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.222
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.222 --> 00:01:31.758
How do you suck
with the stick in the middle?

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:33.159
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:35.528
-I don't like things to get
in my way when I'm sucking.

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:38.364
-You'll learn, you'll learn.
You'll figure it out.

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:40.065
Gosh!

00:01:40.065 --> 00:01:41.534
[ Laughs ]

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:43.636
-This is cheating.

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:46.772
I can imagine you in your house,
you know, practicing.

00:01:46.772 --> 00:01:49.675
-Wait! No, no, no!
Don't -- I'm not practicing.

00:01:49.675 --> 00:01:51.310
-For hours. Okay.

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:53.513
-Hours?!
Trust me.

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:56.749
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.749 --> 00:01:57.983
[ Cymbal crashes ]

00:01:57.983 --> 00:01:59.218
-Let's do this.

00:01:59.218 --> 00:02:01.420
Let's get the sucking
out of the way.

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:03.756
[ Band plays funky music ]

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:06.492
[ Laughter continues ]

00:02:06.492 --> 00:02:09.094
-Also, it's customary
to lock eyes with your opponent

00:02:09.094 --> 00:02:10.229
the whole time.

00:02:10.229 --> 00:02:12.431
[ Chuckles ]
Ready?

00:02:12.431 --> 00:02:16.502
3, 2, 1, slurp.

00:02:16.502 --> 00:02:19.072
[ Band plays bossa nova music ]

00:02:20.706 --> 00:02:22.008
[ Scattered cheers ]

00:02:22.008 --> 00:02:23.242
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.242 --> 00:02:27.046 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:28.314
-Mm!
-Mm!

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:30.350
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:43.696
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:45.999
[ Music tempo quickens ]

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:52.104
[ Bell dinging ]

00:02:52.104 --> 00:02:54.240
Wait! No, I'm not --

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.276
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:56.276 --> 00:02:57.777
Salma!

00:02:59.479 --> 00:03:00.579
-Oh, my God.

00:03:00.579 --> 00:03:02.649
-They're giving it to you.

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:04.449
Dude, you beat me at my --
[ Laughs ]

00:03:04.449 --> 00:03:06.719
-[ Speaking Spanish ]

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:09.522
♪ Da da da da-da, da da ♪
-Nice.

00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:11.423
They're giving it to you.
You did it.

00:03:11.423 --> 00:03:12.592
[ Laughing ] Oh, my God.

00:03:12.592 --> 00:03:13.626
-I'm drunk!

00:03:13.626 --> 00:03:16.129
-That was fun.
It tasted good, too.

00:03:16.129 --> 00:03:17.263
All right. I lost.

00:03:17.263 --> 00:03:18.864
I lost,
so I'm gonna take the loss.

00:03:18.864 --> 00:03:20.399
What does the losing card say?
-Okay, he lost.

00:03:20.399 --> 00:03:22.401
-My losing prize --

00:03:22.401 --> 00:03:26.639
I get to lead an invisible
marching band out of the studio,

00:03:26.639 --> 00:03:29.108
into the elevators,
and out of the building.

00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:31.844
Roots, can we get some
marching band music, please?

00:03:31.844 --> 00:03:34.113
-But you have to go
with a salsa march.

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:37.082
[ Marching band music plays ]

00:03:37.082 --> 00:03:40.019
-This should have been you.
[ Chuckles ]

00:03:40.019 --> 00:03:43.823 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:43.823 --> 00:03:45.091
Salma Hayek, everybody!

00:03:45.091 --> 00:03:46.525
More "Tonight Show"
after the break!

00:03:46.525 --> 00:03:47.760
Stick around!

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:50.696
[ Audience clapping
rhythmically ]

00:03:50.696 --> 00:03:53.132 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:55.101 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

